dpd-de-php
PHP client for the DPD Cloud Service Webservice (DPD Deutschland)

Copyright 2026 Very Code
Homepage: https://very-code.com
Repository: https://github.com/very-code-com/dpd-de-php

This product provides an open-source PHP client for the DPD Cloud Service
Webservice (SOAP + REST), covering shipment creation (setOrder), parcel
tracking (getParcelLifeCycle, getOrderStatus), pickup-point lookup
(getParcelShopFinder) and pickup zip-code rules (getZipCodeRules).

